{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：月度与季度数据变化观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">中国数据中心行业在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>上半年经历了一个增速节奏变化的季度。根据GS最新发布的2Q26预览报告，全国智能算力新增约595 EFLOPS（FP16），折合约0.7GW的AI相关并网容量，低于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>下半年的802 EFLOPS增量，与<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>上半年H20出口管制生效时的水平相当。这一节奏变化主要受芯片供应收紧影响，包括国产和进口芯片均面临交付瓶颈。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUrJnGIhJZrroCE3xKCTSBn0j3fQhWIAUPywVEafP25OXd1hyB57Tx6Fn234DRGZib5pVFAw02ibOeCB3DW1fWTyVicE7dBheSSvg/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_01.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVYrT6nODUeI49ziay6gFTvC1AuZ88ALfOnTibMoDHdhAkkhWte2uWtQaDXPXabrAsbsf0w2Ac4HiaED6CnFjA6ibQfGp45fADkicpE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWx8QichSLaiao2D0tWKOxow3vgNdXnsicaQHzkciatic2cF6Vp5iaaKSBeHrA7UBHicWd9PG6HictSlxGpYzEEvsBMA2a7lhy65KaclVU/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV4Mzz9CXu2UgDFvmLU2WLljqlicqUfw568jA2NDJp5FoM92wKwGOnrsLibWuSgLeLaa6t0sMV2hyTRe85pasdt8oSsoSbStHe00/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 09-GS-China Data Centers-2Q26 Preview-Slower Move-In Pace Weighs on Quarter-But 12-Month Thesis Intact-报告观点VNET GDS -260727</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
